Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Azimuth Drift Over Cable Line 4
- Story & Context: While splicing an unarmored segment of Transatlantic Cable Line 4 off the Grand Banks, technician Kieran Ross accidentally routed pressurized telemetry data into his communications headset and heard a Tokyo idol chorus floating through the hum. Frantic to bottle the sensation, he rented a rotted recording shack in St. John's, pairing a screeching brass slide across his dobro with a frantic 172-BPM liquid breakbeat until the speakers smelled of burning copper wire. When singer Miki Tanabe laid down the runaway hook—"Look through the brass tube, our constellation sinks"—the room went completely quiet as the maritime radio outside began humming along to the exact key of the sub-bass.
